1
00:00:00,685 --> 00:00:02,975
(Sheldon:)Okay. Enough chitchat.

2
00:00:03,438 --> 00:00:06,778
Okay, step one: Locate your emergency key
to our apartment.

3
00:00:06,941 --> 00:00:11,531
Step two: Enter our apartment.
Step three...

4
00:00:12,322 --> 00:00:13,822
(Sheldon:)Enter my bedroom.

5
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:16,700
SHELDON: Step four...
- Yeah, hang on, getting another call.

6
00:00:16,868 --> 00:00:18,368
(Sheldon:)No!

7
00:00:18,536 --> 00:00:21,826
(Sheldon:)Let me tell you something. Personal
robots cannot get here soon enough.

8
00:00:25,418 --> 00:00:29,218
(Raj:)And that bright little star
peeking her head out early today...

9
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:31,380
(Raj:)...that's Venus.

10
00:00:31,549 --> 00:00:32,929
(Summer:)That is so cool.

11
00:00:33,676 --> 00:00:35,056
You know a lot about space.

12
00:00:35,512 --> 00:00:41,392
(Raj:)Come on. When you were on TV in Firefly,
you were actually in space.

13
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,140
(Summer:)You're not one of those guys
who believe that?

14
00:00:44,771 --> 00:00:48,061
(Raj:)You mean one of the hopeless geeks?
No.

15
00:00:48,233 --> 00:00:49,693
(Raj:)Those are crazy people.

16
00:00:49,859 --> 00:00:52,109
[BOTH CHUCKLING]

17
00:00:52,904 --> 00:01:01,024
(Raj:)Howard, be a dear
and get me another one of these.

